# .pii-denylist — LOCAL ONLY (gitignored). Copy to ".pii-denylist" (install.sh does this).
# The pre-commit hook blocks any commit whose ADDED lines contain any term below.
# Put borrower legal names, guarantor surnames, property addresses, and entity names here.
# One term per line. Lines starting with # are ignored. Matching is case-insensitive substring.
#
# Example:
#   Acme Holdings LLC
#   123 Main St
#   Smith
